@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title State Machine — Examination Status

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #111827
  FontSize 14
  StartColor #0F766E
  EndColor #B91C1C
  ArrowColor #455A64
}

[*] --> IN_PROGRESS : Doctor opens examination\n(visits/{id}/open-examination)

IN_PROGRESS --> DONE : Doctor completes\n(examinations/{id}/complete)
IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED : Administrative cancel

DONE --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of IN_PROGRESS
While IN_PROGRESS, doctor can:
- PATCH diagnosis / diseaseId / fee
- PATCH prescriptionItems
- Order services (Phase 2)
end note

note right of DONE
Once DONE:
- No further edits allowed (400 on PATCH)
- Prescription is locked
- Visit status -> DONE (synchronized)
end note

@enduml
